  "id": "strawberry-chicken-salad",
  "name": "Strawberry Chicken Salad",
  "subtitle": "A crisp chicken salad with berries, pecans, and poppy-seed dressing.",
  "description": "Tender chicken, fresh strawberries, crunchy vegetables, and pecans are tossed with a lightly sweet lemon dressing.",
